#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:720
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page refresh"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page refresh (sync vs refresh)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Parent aspect: [Portal data plane](portal-data-plane.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:10
msgid ""
"Outpost/Portal UI keeps data fresh with two distinct verbs. Do not conflate "
"them with PWA / installer “reload”, which updates shell assets only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verbs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Verb        | When                                                           | What happens                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| **sync**    | Habitat reconnect, tab visible again, Offline sync toast retry | Flush outbox; modules that flushed call `refreshAll` (see [offline platform](offline-platform.md))                             |\n"
"| **refresh** | Header **Refresh** button or touch pull-to-refresh             | Re-run the page’s `reload*` / list fetch (online `withOfflineCache` already network-fetches). Same handler for button and pull |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:24
msgid ""
"**Limited auto**: keep sync + existing live channels (chat `stream.*`, "
"`conversation.updated`, `pomodoro.active.changed`, `notification.created`). "
"No global list polling for attention or lists. No unconditional `refreshAll` "
"of every module on visibility when the outbox is empty. Attention routing → "
"[Notification and reminder](notification-and-reminder.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:24
msgid ""
"**Manual refresh required** on product list surfaces so multi-device / agent "
"edits can be pulled on demand."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:24
msgid ""
"**Interaction dimension** (see [UI dimensions](../ui/dimensions.md), agent "
"API in [ui-dimensions](../../.agent/rules/ui-dimensions.md)): pointer uses a "
"header button; touch also gets pull-to-refresh on the primary list. Shell "
"kind does not lock the affordance. Pattern note → [UI patterns](../ui/"
"patterns.md) (PullToRefresh candidate / DataListRow sibling surfaces)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:24
msgid ""
"**Out of scope**: Habitat fan-out for every CRUD entity; adopting the React "
"Query **library** (self-owned hooks on the [Portal data plane](portal-data-"
"plane.md) are fine); turning the offline-sync toast into a page refresh "
"control."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page classes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Class           | Pages                             | Auto                                                                   | Manual                                    |\n"
"| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n"
"| A Stream        | Chat                              | SAP stream + recovery poll                                             | Header refresh (existing)                 |\n"
"| B CRUD outbox   | Task, Project, Diary              | Mount / selection cache-first; local write reload; sync → `refreshAll` | Header + pull-to-refresh                  |\n"
"| C Hybrid outbox | Pomodoro                          | `pomodoro.active.changed`                                              | Offline `refreshAll` for config/stats     |\n"
"| D snapshot      | Email, Notification, Dream, Vault | Mount / dependency load                                                | Header refresh (pull on list where bound) |\n"
"| E Habitat       | Ops lists                         | Load on enter                                                          | Explicit refresh (existing)               |\n"
"| F Settings      | Shell settings                    | Load on open                                                           | Re-read after save                        |\n"
"| G Shell update  | PWA / installer                   | Update check                                                           | Reload / install ≠ business refresh       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementation notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:41
msgid ""
"Shared pull gesture: `@freeanima/ui-kit/composite` `PullToRefresh` (touch-"
"only; ignore starts near the left edge to avoid drawer swipe conflicts). "
"Visual/hit-target norms → [UI foundations](../ui/foundations.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:41
msgid "Copy: `m.habitat_common_refresh` / `m.habitat_common_refreshing`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/page-refresh.md:41
msgid ""
"Follow-up (not required here): soft refresh of the focused module only on "
"visibility with an empty outbox."
msgstr ""
